<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Real Estate Booking Application Form</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 40px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #333;
    }
    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-top: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #999;
      padding-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .section {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .field {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .label {
      font-weight: bold;
      display: inline-block;
      width: 220px;
    }
    .line {
      display: inline-block;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #999;
      width: 300px;
      height: 16px;
    }
    .checkbox {
      margin-right: 10px;
    }
    .signature-block {
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 40px;
      font-size: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid #999;
      padding-top: 10px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>Real Estate Booking Application Form</h1>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>1. Personal Information</h2>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Applicant’s Full Name:</span><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Mother's Name:</span><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Date of Birth:</span><span class="line" style="width: 150px;"></span>
        <span class="label" style="width: 80px;">Nationality:</span><span class="line" style="width: 150px;"></span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Religion:</span><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Email:</span><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Permanent Address:</span><span class="line" style="width: 500px;"></span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>2. Professional Information</h2>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Profession:</span><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Designation:</span><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Organization:</span><span class="line"></span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>3. Project Information</h2>
    <div class="field">
      <span class="label">Residence Type:</span>
      ☐ Resident ☐ Non-Resident ☐ Apartment ☐ Floor
    </div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Project Location:</span><span class="line" style="width: 400px;"></span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Total Price:</span><span class="line" style="width: 100px;"></span>
      <span class="label" style="width: 120px;">Per Share Price:</span><span class="line" style="width: 100px;"></span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Total Project Area:</span><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Number of Shares:</span><span class="line"></span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Instruction (if any):</span><span class="line" style="width: 500px;"></span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>4. Terms & Declaration</h2>
    <p>
      I/We hereby declare that the information furnished is true to the best of my/our knowledge. I/We agree to abide by
      the rules and systems of the company in purchasing the property.
    </p>
    <p>
      I/We agree to become a member of the owner’s association and abide by its rules and regulations.
    </p>
    <div class="field">
      <input type="checkbox" class="checkbox"> I agree to the terms and conditions.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Customer's Signature:</span><span class="line" style="width: 300px;"></span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Date:</span><span class="line" style="width: 150px;"></span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    Corporate Office: House# 39/C (Siraj Convention Center), 4th Floor, Main Road, Block-C, Aftabnagar, Merul Badda, Dhaka-1212
  </div>

</body>
</html>
